   466	 *
   467	 *   The destination address register cannot be used for this: it holds the
   468	 *   programmed start and does not advance while the channel runs (measured --
   469	 *   over six frames it read back exactly the base address every time).  So
   470	 *   the position is reconstructed from the chunk interrupts, which is sound
